{"ticker":"BR","updated":"2026-10-23T22:42:25Z","profile":{"longName":"Broadridge Financial Solutions, Inc.","shortName":"Broadridge Financial Solutions,","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.broadridge.com","fullTimeEmployees":16000,"marketCap":20692318208,"trailingPE":19.091665,"forwardPE":15.834522,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.7675366,"pegRatio":2.02,"targetMeanPrice":213.375,"targetHighPrice":250.0,"targetLowPrice":176.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":8,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.075,"earningsGrowth":0.084,"grossMargins":0.31780002,"operatingMargins":0.24609,"profitMargins":0.15037,"totalRevenue":7476800000,"beta":0.932,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":235.27,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":133.83,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.34},"summary":"Broadridge Financial Solutions, Inc. provides investor communications and technology-driven solutions for the financial services industry in the United States and internationally. The company's Investor Communication Solutions segment handles the proxy materials distribution and voting processes for bank, broker-dealer, corporate issuer, and fund clients; provides fund manager; and various other regulatory communication solutions. The segment also offers ProxyEdge, an institutional voting platform that allows institutional investors to view, manage, and vote multi-custodial holdings, as well as third party vote recommendations; data-driven analytics solutions; international corporate governance solutions; fiduciary-focused learning and development, software and technology, and data and analytics services, as well as automated mutual fund and exchange-traded funds trade processing; content management and omni-channel distribution platform; corporate solutions that revolve around shareholder meetings and proxy, corporate governance, regulatory filings and disclosure, and stock transfer services; corporate issuer solutions; and customer communications solutions. The Global Technology and Operations segment provides solutions that automate the front-to-back transaction lifecycle of equity, mutual fund, fixed income, foreign exchange and exchange-traded derivatives, order capture an","summary_zh":"Broadridge Financial Solutions, Inc. 為美國和國際金融服務業提供投資者溝通和技術驅動的解決方案。該公司的投資者溝通解決方案部門負責為銀行、經紀自營商、企業發行人和基金客戶處理代理材料分發和投票流程；提供基金經理；以及各種其他監管通訊解決方案。該部門還提供 ProxyEdge，這是一個機構投票平台，允許機構投資者查看、管理和投票多託管資產以及第三方投票建議；數據驅動的分析解決方案；國際公司治理解決方案；以信託為中心的學習和開發、軟體和技術、數據和分析服務，以及自動化共同基金和代理公司管理基金交易處理；全球技術和營運部門提供解決方案，使股票、共同基金、固定收益、外匯和交易所交易衍生性商品的前後交易生命週期自動化、訂單捕獲和","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"資訊科技服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":262.03,"h":263.0,"l":256.04,"c":256.69,"v":580500},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":256.86,"h":257.3,"l":255.36,"c":257.29,"v":1292400},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":257.53,"h":259.02,"l":256.34,"c":258.15,"v":459000},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":258.4,"h":258.5,"l":256.27,"c":257.07,"v":542200},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":257.75,"h":258.7,"l":255.61,"c":255.62,"v":817500},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":254.84,"h":256.67,"l":251.23,"c":251.96,"v":706300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":250.8,"h":252.16,"l":247.52,"c":249.82,"v":523900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":250.31,"h":252.11,"l":249.15,"c":252.02,"v":655400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":252.44,"h":253.93,"l":249.24,"c":251.02,"v":542000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":250.54,"h":253.79,"l":249.25,"c":253.43,"v":593100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":252.9,"h":253.06,"l":250.84,"c":252.37,"v":491300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":251.2,"h":252.85,"l":247.71,"c":250.11,"v":566800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":251.13,"h":255.66,"l":250.32,"c":254.82,"v":663200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":253.67,"h":255.74,"l":251.81,"c":252.03,"v":547700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":252.47,"h":253.36,"l":249.67,"c":249.79,"v":405600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":249.48,"h":250.02,"l":244.91,"c":245.61,"v":524400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":246.0,"h":250.26,"l":244.92,"c":245.12,"v":931500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":245.32,"h":247.64,"l":242.42,"c":242.56,"v":555500},{"t":"2025